       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">deadline. Following the mandatory workflow: Step 1 is to call inventory_agent to verify stock for all requested </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">items and restock if necessary before proceeding. Then in Step 2, we will get a price quote from quoting_agent. </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Finally, in Step 3, we will fulfill the order with order_agent. I will first check the inventory for the requested </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">items and quantities.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">requested_items = {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"colorful poster paper\": 500,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"roll of streamers\": 300,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"balloons\": 200</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">request_date = \"2025-04-03\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">delivery_date = \"2025-04-15\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_check_task = f\"Check stock levels for the following items to fulfill an order by {delivery_date}: \" \\</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">                       + \", \".join([f\"{qty} x {item}\" for item, qty in requested_items.items()])</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_response = inventory_agent(task=inventory_check_task, additional_args={\"request_date\": request_date})</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(inventory_response)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
