      "text/html": [
       "<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic\">Output message of the LLM:</span> <span style=\"color: #d4b702; text-decoration-color: #d4b702\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The request is to place an order for paper supplies with a delivery date of April 15, 2025. This is an </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">ORDER request, so according to the workflow, I will first call inventory_agent to check stock and restock if </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">needed, then quoting_agent for pricing, and finally order_agent to fulfill the order. I will pass the items and </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">delivery date through each step.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #79c0ff; text-decoration-color: #79c0ff; background-color: #0d1117; font-weight: bold\"># Prepare items list for order</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">requested_items = {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"A4 paper sheets\": 10000,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"A3 paper sheets\": 5000,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"printer paper reams\": 500</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">request_date = \"2025-04-04\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">delivery_date = \"2025-04-15\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #79c0ff; text-decoration-color: #79c0ff; background-color: #0d1117; font-weight: bold\"># Step 1: Check inventory and restock if needed</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_task = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Check current stock for the following items and their quantities, \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"and restock any insufficient items before proceeding: \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 10,000 sheets of A4 paper\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 5,000 sheets of A3 paper\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 500 reams of printer paper\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    f\"Requested delivery date: {delivery_date}\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    f\"Request date: {request_date}\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_response = inventory_agent(task=inventory_task, additional_args={\"items\": requested_items, </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">\"request_date\": request_date, \"delivery_date\": delivery_date})</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(inventory_response)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
